{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qfk6rn2Rzf1793094697.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《中年好聲音3》亞軍張與辰日前迎來 41 歲生日。人緣甚廣的他除了收到無數個生日蛋糕之外，其歌迷會「與辰同行國際後援會」亦十分有心，特意在香港鬧市買下巨型戶外 LED 廣告牌及巴士燈箱。</p><p></p><p>出名「寵粉」的張與辰絕不辜負歌迷的一番心意，特地抽空親自前往各個應援地點打卡，在社交平台晒出多張與廣告牌的合照：「自己的卡自己打，謝謝『與辰同行國際後援會』。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"92914973-2718-4b7a-839b-02d82cfdab16.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jWeSoosoKm1793094696.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3ea73540-b3c0-4f4d-b331-f3f3e4dfe57f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026AeyHfRTrcg1793094696.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從公開的相片所見，張與辰身穿休閒藍色 T 恤親臨鬧市街頭，站在巨型廣告牌前擺出「V」字手勢自拍；隨後他又造訪了路邊的巴士燈箱及廣告牌，興奮地指着海報上的自己，全程大展燦爛笑容。不少粉絲看到偶像親自「踩場」驗收應援成果後大感驚喜。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.726765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:58:30.250839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:28.215885+00:00","content_hash":"e652f43bd0b515284c61b28accdf31bedfdd10b19c6c7a8c79a6a7f9e2b2e603","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:02.726765+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}